---

{/* Site-name markup: Landing only renders on the locale home pages, so this is
    the one place Google should see a WebSite entity. */}
<SiteJsonLd locale={locale} />

<div class="m3-lp not-content">
	<header class="m3-lp__hero">
		<p class="m3-lp__eyebrow">{t('Local proxy', '로컬 프록시', '本地代理', 'Локальный прокси', 'ローカルプロキシ')}</p>
		<h1 class="m3-lp__title">{t(
			'Use any LLM with Codex and Claude Code.',
			'Codex와 Claude Code에서 어떤 LLM이든.',
			'在 Codex 与 Claude Code 中使用任意 LLM。',
			'Любая LLM в Codex и Claude Code.',
			'Codex と Claude Code で、どの LLM でも。',
		)}</h1>
		<p class="m3-lp__lede">{t(
			'opencodex runs on your machine and speaks the Codex Responses API, the Claude Messages API and Grok Build — then routes each turn to whichever provider you pointed it at.',
			'opencodex는 내 컴퓨터에서 실행되며 Codex Responses API, Claude Messages API, Grok Build를 이해하고, 각 턴을 지정한 프로바이더로 라우팅합니다.',
			'opencodex 运行在你自己的机器上，能讲 Codex Responses API、Claude Messages API 与 Grok Build，并把每一轮请求路由到你指定的提供商。',
			'opencodex работает на вашей машине, понимает Codex Responses API, Claude Messages API и Grok Build и направляет каждый ход выбранному провайдеру.',
			'opencodex は手元のマシンで動き、Codex Responses API・Claude Messages API・Grok Build を話し、各ターンを指定のプロバイダーへ振り分けます。',
		)}</p>

		<div class="m3-lp__cta">
			<a class="m3-lp__btn m3-lp__btn--filled" href={`${prefix}getting-started/quickstart/`}>
				{t('Get started', '시작하기', '开始使用', 'Начать', 'はじめる')}
			</a>
			<a class="m3-lp__btn m3-lp__btn--outlined" href="https://github.com/lidge-jun/opencodex">GitHub</a>
		</div>

		<ul class="m3-lp__providers" aria-label={t('Supported providers', '지원 프로바이더', '支持的提供商', 'Поддерживаемые провайдеры', '対応プロバイダー')}>
			{providers.map(provider => (
				<li class="m3-lp__provider">
					{provider.path && (
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" aria-hidden="true"><path d={provider.path} fill="currentColor" /></svg>
					)}
					<span>{provider.label}</span>
				</li>
			))}
		</ul>
	</header>

	<div class="m3-lp__tabs" data-m3-tabs>
		<div class="m3-lp__tablist" role="tablist" aria-label={t('Sections', '섹션', '章节', 'Разделы', 'セクション')}>
			{tabs.map((tab, i) => (
				<button
					type="button"
					role="tab"
					id={`m3-tab-${tab.id}`}
					aria-controls={`m3-panel-${tab.id}`}
					aria-selected={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
					tabindex={i === 0 ? 0 : -1}
